  "title": "Natural Gas Piping - Sizing vs. Capacity",
  "description": "Sizing natural gas pipes with pressures above 5 psi (35 kPa). Calculate pipe capacity based on pressure, pipe diameter, and pipe length using Steel Pipe Schedule 40.",
  "type": "calculator",
  "components": [
